      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "大剣闘祭の参加者よ聞け！\nとうとう我々を本気にさせてしまったようだな。\n次の戦いで因縁の戦いに終止符を打つとしよう。\nウラノス山で待つ。いいか？　逃げるなよ！",
        "official_en": "You! Competitor of the Heroic Games! You defeated\nus handily in our previous duels, but this time we are\nprepared! Meet us upon Mount Ouranos, where our\nrivalry will be brought to an end! ",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
