      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "またまた勝てなかったな……\n山ごもりまでして鍛えたのに、ザマあねえぜ。\n大剣闘祭に出るのは、お前たちこそ相応しい。\n健闘を祈ってるぜ。あばよ！",
        "official_en": "We lost. Again. Even after all our training in the\nmountains, we lost. You are truly worthy of your\nspot in the Heroic Games. Good luck in your\nbattles, and farewell!",
        "real_en": null
      },
